.scratch/
tools/.eu-dict/
node_modules/
.DS_Store

# preflight screenshots, regenerated on every run
tools/.preflight-shots/

# Planning, strategy and pricing notes do not belong here. This repo is PUBLIC:
# GitHub Pages serves ikasiandgo.com from it, and installed apps fetch
# vocabulary.json from it at launch, so it cannot be made private either.
# Anything committed here is on the internet. A launch strategy doc with
# pricing in it sat at the repo root for 99 days before anyone noticed, and
# removing it took a history rewrite plus a request to GitHub Support.
#
# So: every markdown file at the root is ignored except README.md. Keep notes
# in ~/Downloads/Ikasi. If a new root document genuinely belongs in the repo,
# add it deliberately with  git add -f <file>
/*.md
!/README.md
